### loan-disbursement — full lifecycle driver
### Start runtime (localhost:4201) and MockLab (docker compose up -d mocklab) first.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4201
@apiVersion = 1
@domain = core
@workflowKey = loan-disbursement

### 1. Start an instance (submit-application — start transition, schema loan-application)
# @name startInstance
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/start?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-1001",
  "productType": "ihtiyac",
  "requestedAmount": 75000,
  "currency": "TRY",
  "termMonths": 36,
  "monthlyIncome": 32000,
  "purpose": "Ev tadilatı"
}

### Capture the new instance id
@instanceId = {{startInstance.response.body.id}}

### 2. Get the instance (application-intake; auto-advances through credit-bureau-inquiry subflow)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}

### 3. List available transitions (expect submit-assessment once in assessment-pricing)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions

### 4. submit-assessment (T3 — schema loan-assessment; score-and-limit + price-loan)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/submit-assessment?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approvedLimit": 75000,
  "interestRate": 3.59,
  "insurancePremium": 450,
  "monthlyInstallment": 2380,
  "apr": 4.12,
  "internalRating": "B",
  "riskScore": 72
}

### 5. approve (T4 — schema loan-approval-decision; dynamic approver role from limit)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/approve?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decisionReason": "Skor ve gelir uygun",
  "conditions": "Maaş müşterisi olma şartı",
  "approverUserId": "USER-APPROVER-1"
}

### 6. Get the instance (collateral-establishment subflow → disbursement → disbursed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}

### --- Rejection path (alternative to step 5) ---
### reject (T5 — schema loan-rejection)
# PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflowKey}}/instances/{{instanceId}}/transitions/reject?sync=true
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "rejectionReason": "Yetersiz kredi notu",
#   "rejectionCode": "LOW_SCORE"
# }

### 7. Call the loan-product-lov function (domain scope D)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/functions/loan-product-lov
